0012: It is TKI study, I must clarify it's TKI but relevant for confounding discussion. My draft says \"在酪氨酸激酶抑制剂治疗中... 提示... 普遍负面影响\". This is accurate.\nOne check on P0024: HIV study. My draft says \"例如在 HIV 感染模型中... 类比提示\". This is accurate.\nOne check on P0558: Timing study. My draft says \"非微生物因素如给药时间生物学\". Accurate.\n\nI will combine these into the final JSON.\nI need to make sure I don't produce any markdown outside the JSON value for `body_markdown`.\nThe output format is `{\"body_markdown\": \"...\", \"issues\": []}`.\n\nLet's double check the paragraph tasks.\nP01: Point \"界定观察性关联的因果倒置风险\". My draft covers this.\nP02: Point \"评估药物与生活方式暴露的混杂干扰\". My draft covers this.\nP03: Point \"剖析跨物种机制外推的生理鸿沟\". My draft covers this.\nP04: Point \"审视统计推断工具的适用边界\". My draft covers this.\n\nI will ensure the paragraphs are separated by newlines in the markdown string.\nI will ensure no extra spaces or formatting issues.\nI will ensure the citation numbers match the `source_handle` keys (e.g. `P0031` not `31`). The instruction says \"正文里用 `[P0000]` 标注来源（handle 原样使用）\". So `[P0031]` is correct.\n\nFinal check on P0478: It is in the `sources` array in the input JSON provided to me. So I can use it.\nWait, looking at the `sources` array in the input JSON...\nIt starts with P0031, P0433, P0561, P0012, P0171, P0375, P0558, P0229, P0525, P0024, P0059, P0005, P0010, P0545.\nThen at the very end, there is P0478.\nOkay, so P0478 is available.\n\nOne detail: `chapter_tool_materials` has `usable_content` for P0478 which gives specific stats (PERMANOVA, AUC-ROC). I should incorporate some of these specific details to make the argument stronger (e.g. \"cohort explains 10x variance\", \"AUC drops to 0.59\").\nMy draft for P01 says: \"“队列”因素对微生物群落变异的解释力远超临床变量... 泛化能力显著下降\". I can add the specific numbers from the tool material content provided in the JSON for P0478 (which is also in the sources list with study_summary_A).\nThe `study_summary_A` for P0478 in the `sources` list says: \"PER